# Paths are relative to music/. The index itself needs no rule — the repo root
# .gitignore already covers *.db, *.db-shm and *.db-wal.
#
# NB: git only treats '#' as a comment at the start of a line, so every note here
# sits on its own line. A trailing comment would become part of the pattern.

# Bounded LRU of mel matrices. Every one is regenerable from the source audio,
# and the full set would be ~75 GB (ALGORITHMS.md §4).
.cache/

# Vendored encoder weights (§8.5) — hundreds of MB, fetched not committed.
# Reproducible byte-for-byte from the pinned commit + checksum in models/README.md.
models/*.onnx

# The contained venv (§8.5). This host's Python is PEP 668 externally-managed, so
# onnxruntime cannot be installed system-wide; see models/README.md.
.venv/

# Rendered ridgelines (§8.3) and query output.
out/

# The backfill's pid file, written by control.py. Machine state, not source.
.backfill.pid
